      "name": "Nút chính",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "button-primary",
      "description": "Thao tác chính trên nền sáng.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-button-primary\">Ghép ảnh</button>",
      "css": ".ds-button-primary{font-family:var(--sans,\"Be Vietnam Pro\",\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif);display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;min-height:46px;padding:12px 18px;border:1px solid var(--wine,#4b332a);border-radius:10px;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.45;cursor:pointer;transition:background-color 160ms ease-out,border-color 160ms ease-out;background:var(--wine,#4b332a);color:#fff}.ds-button-primary:hover:not(:disabled),.ds-button-primary:active:not(:disabled){background:var(--wine-dark,#34231d);border-color:var(--wine-dark,#34231d)}.ds-button-primary:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--wine,#4b332a);outline-offset:3px;}.ds-button-primary:disabled{opacity:.48;cursor:not-allowed}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-button-primary{transition-duration:.01ms}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Nút phụ",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "button-outline",
      "description": "Thao tác hỗ trợ dùng viền và chữ nâu.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-button-outline\">Quay lại</button>",
      "css": ".ds-button-outline{font-family:var(--sans,\"Be Vietnam Pro\",\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif);display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;min-height:46px;padding:12px 18px;border:1px solid var(--wine,#4b332a);border-radius:10px;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.45;cursor:pointer;transition:background-color 160ms ease-out,border-color 160ms ease-out;background:var(--surface,#fff);border-color:var(--line,#dcd3c8);color:var(--wine,#4b332a)}.ds-button-outline:hover:not(:disabled){background:var(--stone,#eee8df);border-color:#a99688}.ds-button-outline:active:not(:disabled){background:var(--wine-dark,#34231d);color:#fff}.ds-button-outline:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--wine,#4b332a);outline-offset:3px;}.ds-button-outline:disabled{opacity:.48;cursor:not-allowed}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-button-outline{transition-duration:.01ms}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Ô nhập",
      "kind": "input",
      "refersTo": "input",
      "description": "Vùng nhập trắng, focus nâu rõ; chữ 16px trên điện thoại.",
      "html": "<input class=\"ds-input\" aria-label=\"Mã chụp\" placeholder=\"Nhập mã chụp\">",
      "css": ".ds-input{font-family:var(--sans,\"Be Vietnam Pro\",\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif);min-height:46px;padding:12px 14px;border:1px solid var(--line,#dcd3c8);border-radius:10px;background:var(--surface,#fff);color:var(--ink,#302822);font-size:14px;caret-color:var(--wine,#4b332a);transition:border-color 160ms ease-out}.ds-input::placeholder{color:var(--muted,#72665d);opacity:1}.ds-input:focus{border-color:var(--wine,#4b332a)}.ds-input:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--wine,#4b332a);outline-offset:3px;}.ds-input[aria-invalid=\"true\"]{border-color:#ad3930}@media(max-width:760px){.ds-input{font-size:16px}}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-input{transition-duration:.01ms}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Điều hướng đang chọn",
