      "description": "Mục hiện tại nâu đặc, nhãn dài xuống dòng.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-nav\" aria-current=\"page\"><svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M3 10 12 3l9 7v10a1 1 0 0 1-1 1h-5v-7H9v7H4a1 1 0 0 1-1-1Z\"/></svg><span>Tổng quan</span></button>",
      "css": ".ds-nav{font-family:var(--sans,\"Be Vietnam Pro\",\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif);display:flex;align-items:center;gap:11px;min-height:46px;padding:11px 12px;border:0;border-radius:10px;background:var(--wine,#4b332a);color:#fff;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.5;white-space:normal;text-align:left;cursor:pointer;transition:background-color 160ms ease,color 160ms ease}.ds-nav span{min-width:0;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.ds-nav svg{flex-shrink:0}.ds-nav:hover,.ds-nav:active{background:var(--wine,#4b332a)}.ds-nav:focus-visible{outline:2px solid var(--wine,#4b332a);outline-offset:3px;}@media(max-width:760px){.ds-nav{min-height:48px;padding:11px;font-size:12px}}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-nav{transition-duration:.01ms}}"
    },
